          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On March 17, 2009, around 8:10 PM, a witness observed the eastward/northeasterly movement of two white glowing discs that appeared to be connected by a mass. During the day, at the time of the observation, the space shuttle was in the approach phase to the International Space Station (ISS). The testimony is consistent with the observation of this \"team\". This case is classified \"A\": observation of the shuttle approaching the ISS.",
